  "prefLabel": "Gcd 202.04 Forms of Dispute Resolution",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 202.04 Forms of Dispute Resolution. Disputes between any person and the commission shall be resolved by:\n\n(a) Agreement pursuant to Gcd 215.01;\n\n(b) Formal settlement pursuant to Gcd 215.02; or\n\n(c) Decision after hearing made pursuant to Gcd 211.08.\n\nSource. #7635-A, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10339, eff 5-17-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gcd100-400.html"
